// `manual_corpus_eval_host_run_specs` (single authority; no parallel bash claim-list).
// Executed-row drift gates project TestClaimRun verdict+reason via modeled witnesses (--claim-run).
// HostRejected arm retained for future pre-TestClaimRun transport rows (none in the 6-row roster today).

